{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/github' data-target='computer\/program\/github' data-title='GitHub'>\r\n\t\t\tGitHub\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Actions: Pull repo from another, steps, jobs, - name: checkout repo, with, and ?Same user’s repos.","label":"Actions","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/github\/org_readme","label":"Org-readme","url":"\/computer\/program\/github\/org_readme"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Pull repo from another<\/h2>\n\t<h4>steps<\/h4>\n\t<h2>jobs<\/h2>\n\t<h4>- name: checkout repo<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>uses.<\/strong> Actions\/checkout@v2.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>with<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>repository:&lt;user&gt;\/&lt;repo&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ref: ${{ vars.ENV }}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>token: ${{ secrets.PAT_TOKEN }}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>path.<\/strong> .\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>?Same user\u2019s repos<\/h2>\n\t<h4>secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInitialised by default.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>2. PAT : personal access token<\/h2>\n\t<h4>from github account &gt; Developer settings (bottom left in the settings page)<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t&gt; classic token &gt; repo access.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tModern tokens were unable to access.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol clas